cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in academic work, please cite the
  preferred-citation below (the open-access 2014 SpringerPlus paper
  that introduces the algorithms implemented here). The earlier 2012
  WWW conference paper is included under references.
title: "vcp — Vertex Collocation Profiles"
abstract: >-
  Header-only C++ library and companion CLI tools for computing Vertex
  Collocation Profiles (VCPs) over graphs. Provides processor- and
  memory-efficient compressed-sparse-row graph representations, VCP
  algorithm template classes with hand-tuned specializations, and
  static / dynamic subgraph-to-element mappers.
type: software
authors:
